{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"何西阿書","commonName":"何西阿書","title":"何西阿書","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"1390c0b166f5f648615cbddd0fc0981a1b1280f32e03791ade9afbe66f074180","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":197},"chapter":{"number":2,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["「你們要稱你們的弟兄為阿米",{"noteId":3},"，要稱你們的姊妹為路哈瑪",{"noteId":4},"。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["對不貞之婦的控訴"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"text":"「你們去跟你們的母親理論吧！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為她不再是我的妻子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也不再是她的丈夫。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"叫她別再出賣色相，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"別再露出乳間的淫態。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不然，我要剝光她的衣服，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使她像初生之時一樣赤身露體；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使她像沙漠，如旱地，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"乾渴而死。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也不憐憫她的兒女，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為他們都是娼妓所生的兒女。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們的母親淫亂放蕩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"懷他們的人行為可恥，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她竟說，『我要跟隨我的情人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們給我食物和水、羊毛和麻布、油和酒。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，我要用荊棘圍堵她的道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"築牆阻斷她的去路。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她要追隨情人，卻追不上；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"尋找情人，卻找不到。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"於是，她說，『我倒不如回到丈夫身邊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我從前的光景比現在還好。』","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她不知道是我給她五穀、新酒和油，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又賜給她大量金銀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她卻用這些供奉巴力。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因此，到了收割和釀酒的季節，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要收走我的五穀和新酒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"奪回我給她遮體的羊毛和麻布。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要當著她情人的面揭露她的淫蕩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"無人能從我手中把她救出去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要終止她一切的歡慶，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"終止她的節日、朔日","poem":1},{"noteId":5},{"text":"、安息日及其他節期。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她說她的葡萄樹和無花果樹是情人給她的嫖資，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要摧毀它們，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使它們變為荒林，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被野獸吞吃。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要懲罰她，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為她在節日向巴力燒香。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時她戴耳環佩首飾，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"追逐她的情人，把我忘記。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["對不貞之婦的愛"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"「然而，我要引導她，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"領她到曠野，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"柔聲安慰她。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要把葡萄園再賜給她，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使災禍之谷","poem":1},{"noteId":6},{"text":"成為希望之門。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"她要在那裡歡唱，如在妙齡之時，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如從埃及出來之日。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「那時，你要稱我為丈夫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不再稱我為主人","poem":1},{"noteId":7},{"text":"。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要從你口中除掉巴力的名字，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"再也不讓你提起它們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那時，我要跟田間的走獸、空中的飛鳥及地上的爬蟲立約。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要從地上折弓斷劍，廢止戰事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使你安居樂業。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要聘你永遠做我的妻，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以仁義、正直、慈愛、憐憫聘你為妻。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要以信實聘你為妻，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這樣你必認識耶和華。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"text":"耶和華說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「那時，我要應允，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要應允天的祈求，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"天要應允地的祈求，","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"地要應允五穀、新酒和油的祈求，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"五穀、新酒和油要應允耶斯列的祈求。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":23,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要把你栽種在這片土地上，歸我所有。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要憐憫那不蒙憐憫的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"對那不是我子民的人說，『你是我的子民。』","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們也要對我說，『你是我的上帝。』」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":3,"caller":"+","text":"「阿米」意思是「我的子民」。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":1}},{"noteId":4,"caller":"+","text":"「路哈瑪」意思是「得蒙憐憫」。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":1}},{"noteId":5,"caller":"+","text":"「朔日」即每月初一。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":11}},{"noteId":6,"caller":"+","text":"「災禍之谷」希伯來文是「亞割谷」，「亞割」意思是「災禍」。參見約書亞記第七章。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":15}},{"noteId":7,"caller":"+","text":"此處的「主人」希伯來文是「巴力」。「巴力」意思是「主人或丈夫」，也是迦南人神明的名字。","reference":{"chapter":2,"verse":16}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/2.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/3.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/HOS/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":23}